        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870960/extras/75dbe4ce8a60c8f2de01817ceecc7d80.avif?t=1762285417\" width=600 height=128 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hey, Detective! Ready for a strange case?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i><strong>Lost in Loss</strong></i>, strange things are happening: citizens are forgetting themselves, becoming odd, distorted versions of who they used to be. Your mission? Explore hand-drawn locations, uncover hidden objects tied to each person’s past, and figure out <i>why</i> their true selves are slipping away.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870960/extras/c77bcbb5992250aaa0ded2aca4b2db65.avif?t=1762285417\" width=600 height=128 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every scene is a memory — scattered and waiting. Explore hand-drawn places, uncover hidden clues, and piece together stories through meaningful objects and forgotten moments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870960/extras/0951db99d24502a76e0e2ef239b16260.poster.avif?t=1762285417\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870960/extras/0951db99d24502a76e0e2ef239b16260.webm?t=1762285417\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870960/extras/0951db99d24502a76e0e2ef239b16260.mp4?t=1762285417\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870960/extras/d2c38308a414b47a34196f93c90ad7bd.avif?t=1762285417\" width=600 height=128 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The citizens you meet have forgotten who they are — a little lost, with memory gaps, but still sweet and funny. Help them recover their memories and rediscover who they truly are.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870960/extras/dd7a1c7c3859f17c3fd721ca3f9e8ea9.poster.avif?t=1762285417\" width=604 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870960/extras/dd7a1c7c3859f17c3fd721ca3f9e8ea9.webm?t=1762285417\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870960/extras/dd7a1c7c3859f17c3fd721ca3f9e8ea9.mp4?t=1762285417\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870960/extras/01dee795a3b2645cb45be508ebb2f22c.avif?t=1762285417\" width=600 height=128 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some memories resist being found. Some moments are hidden behind locks, symbols, or little contradictions. Solve puzzles woven into each character’s forgotten past.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870960/extras/774f26ef8d6aaaa5ac7ed2eea81f9a3d.poster.avif?t=1762285417\" width=800 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870960/extras/774f26ef8d6aaaa5ac7ed2eea81f9a3d.webm?t=1762285417\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870960/extras/774f26ef8d6aaaa5ac7ed2eea81f9a3d.mp4?t=1762285417\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870960/extras/3722b301ee1a841fe098e42ab9ae5c45.avif?t=1762285417\" width=600 height=128 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🧘 <strong>Relaxing, Meditative Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy a calm and peaceful adventure with no time limits or pressure — play at your own pace.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🕵️ <strong>2–3 Hours of Engaging Mystery</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into a short but captivating journey filled with secrets, discoveries, and a touch of magic.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >📖 <strong>Rich Storyline</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover an emotional narrative as you explore, piece by piece, a mysterious world full of meaning.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🌟 <strong>Memorable Characters</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet unique characters, each with their own backgrounds, personalities, and stories to share.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🧩 <strong>Thoughtful Puzzles</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve a variety of creative and atmospheric puzzles that enhance the story and exploration.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🎮 <strong>Full Gamepad Support</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sit back, relax, and enjoy the whole journey with full gamepad support.</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870960/extras/75dbe4ce8a60c8f2de01817ceecc7d80.avif?t=1762285417\" width=600 height=128 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hey, Detective! Ready for a strange case?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i><strong>Lost in Loss</strong></i>, strange things are happening: citizens are forgetting themselves, becoming odd, distorted versions of who they used to be. Your mission? Explore hand-drawn locations, uncover hidden objects tied to each person’s past, and figure out <i>why</i> their true selves are slipping away.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870960/extras/c77bcbb5992250aaa0ded2aca4b2db65.avif?t=1762285417\" width=600 height=128 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every scene is a memory — scattered and waiting. Explore hand-drawn places, uncover hidden clues, and piece together stories through meaningful objects and forgotten moments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870960/extras/0951db99d24502a76e0e2ef239b16260.poster.avif?t=1762285417\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870960/extras/0951db99d24502a76e0e2ef239b16260.webm?t=1762285417\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870960/extras/0951db99d24502a76e0e2ef239b16260.mp4?t=1762285417\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870960/extras/d2c38308a414b47a34196f93c90ad7bd.avif?